[{"answer":"Good morning. I'd like to open a bank account, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like to take a seat, I'll just get some details from you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"It won't take long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it a current account or a deposit account you wanted?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"A current account.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got the application form here then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"We have different types - I see you've got our leaflet there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I've decided on the one called 'Select.'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, that's fine, so, first of all, can I have your full name please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's Pieter Henes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That's PIETER.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it HENNES?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, only one N actually. It's a less common spelling of the name.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right. Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's your date of birth please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The 27th of the first, 1973.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And will this be a joint account?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"No, just myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And where are you living, Mr Henes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"15, Riverside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that all one word?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Exeter?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/29.mp3"},{"answer":"How long have you been at your present address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, is it more than two years?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, just two weeks actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I only arrived in the country a month ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm from Holland.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But we normally ask for a previous address in that case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, well, it's Rielsdorf 2.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That's RIELSDORF 2, Utrecht.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Holland.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a daytime telephone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think the number at my office is 606295.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, just a minute, I'd better check.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, no, sorry, 616. I'm not used to it yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like my home number too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 796431.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they both local numbers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. And your occupation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm in Britain as a project manager, but that's not my main job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm an engineer by profession.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll put that then. It's shorter!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we usually ask for a piece of information which we can use to check your identity, for security reasons.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/55.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, if you phone us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, erm, my wife's first name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Mother's might be better. It's less likely to be known.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Hers is Siti.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Siti?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, SITI.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Indonesian.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much would you like to open your account with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/64.mp3"},{"answer":"We usually ask for a minimum sum of £50.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That's about €75.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm going to transfer €2,000 from my Dutch account, just till I get paid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/67.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I wanted to ask you about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/68.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the best way to do it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/69.mp3"},{"answer":"It depends which bank you're with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the Fransen Bank in Utrecht.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/71.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, fine. I'll check that in a minute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/72.mp3"},{"answer":"If we have links with them we can do a direct transfer. But it's not a big problem either way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/74.mp3"},{"answer":"How often would you like to receive statements?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/75.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't really thought.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/76.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the usual thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/77.mp3"},{"answer":"It's up to you. Some people like them weekly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, no, that's too often.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I have them sent, um, once a month?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/82.mp3"},{"answer":"I was thinking of registering for your internet service at some stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like me to send you information about that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Please, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/86.mp3"},{"answer":"And would you like to receive information about the bank's other services -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/87.mp3"},{"answer":"insurance, loans, anything like that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, I don't think so, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/89.mp3"},{"answer":"That's okay then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/90.mp3"},{"answer":"And one last thing, if you agree...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-1-2023-08-02-10-56-41/91.mp3"}]
